  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Arts and conflict transformation in Myanmar. Participatory workshops and peace education in minority areas</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Network using academic and arts participatory workshops to generate knowledge about how artistic interventions transform conflicts and widen access to education in Myanmar. Working with marginalised communities and peace educators. SDG 4, 10, 16.</narrative>
  </description>
  <description type="2">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The Global Challenges Research Fund (GCRF) supports cutting-edge research to address challenges faced by developing countries. The fund addresses the UN sustainable development goals. It aims to maximise the impact of research and innovation to improve lives and opportunity in the developing world.</narrative>
  </description>
